{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41559","headline":"碧户 · 张泌","name":"碧户","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"碧户扃鱼鏁，兰窗掩镜台。\n落花疑怅望，归燕自裴回。\n咏絮知难敌，伤春不易裁。\n恨从芳草起，愁爲晚风来。\n衣惹湘云薄，眉分楚岫开。\n香浓眠旧枕，梦好醉春杯。\n小障明金凤，幽屏点翠苔。\n宝筝横塞鴈，怨笛落江梅。\n卓氏仍多酒，相如正富才。\n莫教琴上意，翻作鹤声哀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张泌","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41559.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41559","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}